# Concurrent-C ILP32 smoke image — Linux i386.
#
# Build:
#   docker build --platform linux/386 -f scripts/docker/Dockerfile.i386 -t ccc-i386 .
# Run (RO source + writable sandbox; preferred):
#   docker run --rm --platform linux/386 \
#     -v "$PWD":/src:ro -v /work \
#     -e CCC_ILP32_ARCH=i386 ccc-i386 /src/scripts/docker/ilp32_entrypoint.sh
#
# Or: ./scripts/smoke_i386.sh
#
# ARM32 follow-up: same packages/CMD in Dockerfile.arm32 (stub); swap base + --platform.

FROM i386/debian:bookworm

RUN apt-get update && apt-get install -y --no-install-recommends \
    build-essential \
    ca-certificates \
    file \
    git \
    libzopfli-dev \
    make \
    pkg-config \
    libpython3-dev \
    python3 \
    rsync \
    zlib1g-dev \
    && rm -rf /var/lib/apt/lists/*

WORKDIR /work
ENV CCC_ILP32_ARCH=i386
ENV CCC_ILP32_SRC=/src
ENV CCC_ILP32_WORK=/work
CMD ["/src/scripts/docker/ilp32_entrypoint.sh"]
